---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Dumpsters Now"
  description="Read the Privacy Policy for Dumpsters Now. Learn how we collect, protect, and handle your personal information when requesting dumpster quotes or booking online in Metro Detroit."
  canonical="https://dumpstersnow.com/privacy/"
  activePage="privacy"
>
  <section class="hero-section" style="padding: 50px 0 35px; text-align: center;">
    <div class="container" style="max-width: 850px; margin: 0 auto;">
      <span class="banner-pill" style="margin-bottom: 15px;">Legal & Transparency</span>
      <h1 class="hero-title" style="font-size: 2.5rem; line-height: 1.2;">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p style="font-size: 1.05rem; color: #94a3b8; margin-top: 10px;">
        Last Updated: January 1, 2026
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section style="padding: 60px 0 90px; background-color: var(--bg-cream);">
    <div class="container" style="max-width: 850px; margin: 0 auto;">
      <div style="background: #ffffff; border: 3px solid #000000; box-shadow: 6px 6px 0px #000000; border-radius: 12px; padding: 40px 35px; color: var(--text-dark); line-height: 1.7; font-size: 1rem;">
        
        <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 900; margin-bottom: 15px; border-bottom: 2px solid #e2e8f0; padding-bottom: 8px;">
          1. Introduction
        </h2>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 25px; color: #475569;">
          Dumpsters Now ("we," "our," or "us") is dedicated to safeguarding your personal privacy. This Privacy Policy details how we collect, use, disclose, and protect your information when you access our website at <strong>dumpstersnow.com</strong>, request a roll-off dumpster quote, or book waste management services online across Metro Detroit, Michigan.
        </p>

        <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 900; margin-bottom: 15px; border-bottom: 2px solid #e2e8f0; padding-bottom: 8px;">
          2. Information We Collect
        </h2>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 15px; color: #475569;">
          We collect personal and technical information when you interact with our website, request quotes, or utilize our booking tools, including:
        </p>
        <ul style="margin-bottom: 25px; padding-left: 20px; color: #475569;">
          <li><strong>Contact Details:</strong> Your name, telephone number, email address, and service delivery address submitted through quote forms, booking portals, or phone consultations.</li>
          <li><strong>Rental & Job Specifications:</strong> Requested container size (15, 20, 30, or 40-yard), desired delivery date, placement instructions (e.g., driveway or street), and debris category (residential, construction, junk, or roofing materials).</li>
          <li><strong>Automated & Technical Data:</strong> Browser type, operating system, IP address, referral sources, pages viewed, time spent on site, and interaction data captured via cookies, Google Analytics, and Microsoft Clarity.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 900; margin-bottom: 15px; border-bottom: 2px solid #e2e8f0; padding-bottom: 8px;">
          3. How We Use Your Information
        </h2>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 15px; color: #475569;">
          We process your information for legitimate operational and business purposes, including:
        </p>
        <ul style="margin-bottom: 25px; padding-left: 20px; color: #475569;">
          <li>Processing dumpster rental orders, confirming drop-off schedules, and managing roll-off pickup logistics.</li>
          <li>Sending order confirmations, driver ETA updates, delivery notifications, and invoices via phone, SMS, or email.</li>
          <li>Providing timely customer support, answering inquiries, and coordinating driveway placement details.</li>
          <li>Analyzing web traffic, monitoring site security, preventing fraudulent activity, and improving user experience.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 900; margin-bottom: 15px; border-bottom: 2px solid #e2e8f0; padding-bottom: 8px;">
          4. SMS & Mobile Communications Policy
        </h2>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 25px; color: #475569;">
          By providing your phone number on our website forms or booking system, you give consent to receive order-related phone calls and text messages (SMS) regarding your dumpster rental dispatch, status, and service updates. <strong>No mobile information will be shared with third parties or affiliates for marketing or promotional purposes.</strong> All text messaging opt-in data and consent will not be shared, sold, or transferred to any third party. You may opt out of SMS communications at any time by replying STOP.
        </p>

        <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 900; margin-bottom: 15px; border-bottom: 2px solid #e2e8f0; padding-bottom: 8px;">
          5. Information Sharing & Third Parties
        </h2>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 25px; color: #475569;">
          We do not sell, rent, lease, or trade your personal information to third parties. We may disclose information only to vetted third-party vendors and service providers who help us operate our website, process payments, host data, or service customer accounts, strictly bound by confidentiality obligations.
        </p>

        <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 900; margin-bottom: 15px; border-bottom: 2px solid #e2e8f0; padding-bottom: 8px;">
          6. Cookies & Tracking Technologies
        </h2>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 25px; color: #475569;">
          We use cookies, web beacons, and tracking pixels to analyze user interaction, remember quote preferences, and measure conversion data from advertising campaigns (such as Google Ads and Microsoft Advertising). You can adjust your browser settings to decline cookies or alert you when cookies are placed.
        </p>

        <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 900; margin-bottom: 15px; border-bottom: 2px solid #e2e8f0; padding-bottom: 8px;">
          7. Data Security
        </h2>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 25px; color: #475569;">
          We utilize commercial-grade security protocols, including Secure Sockets Layer (SSL/HTTPS) encryption, firewalls, and restricted administrative access to protect your personal data from unauthorized access, loss, or misuse.
        </p>

        <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 900; margin-bottom: 15px; border-bottom: 2px solid #e2e8f0; padding-bottom: 8px;">
          8. Your Rights & Choices
        </h2>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 25px; color: #475569;">
          You have the right to request access to the personal data we hold about you, request corrections, or request deletion of your information from our active records. To exercise these rights, please contact us using the information below.
        </p>

        <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 900; margin-bottom: 15px; border-bottom: 2px solid #e2e8f0; padding-bottom: 8px;">
          9. Contact Us
        </h2>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 15px; color: #475569;">
          If you have questions, feedback, or concerns regarding this Privacy Policy or our data handling practices, please contact us:
        </p>
        <div style="background: #f8fafc; border: 2.5px solid #000000; box-shadow: 4px 4px 0px #000; border-radius: 8px; padding: 22px; font-weight: 600;">
          <p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0; font-size: 1.1rem;"><strong>Dumpsters Now</strong></p>
          <p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0; color: #475569;">Address: 7374 Chubb Rd, Northville, MI 48168</p>
          <p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0; color: #475569;">Toll-Free Phone: <a href="tel:888-870-9906" style="color: var(--primary-red); font-weight: 800;">(888) 870-9906</a></p>
          <p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0; color: #475569;">Direct Phone: <a href="tel:313-634-7929" style="color: var(--primary-red); font-weight: 800;">(313) 634-7929</a></p>
          <p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0; color: #475569;">Email: <a href="mailto:hysam@dumpstersnow.com" style="color: var(--primary-orange); text-decoration: underline;">hysam@dumpstersnow.com</a></p>
          <p style="margin: 0; color: #475569;">Service Region: Metro Detroit & Wayne, Oakland, and Washtenaw Counties, MI</p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
